dardasha (1.10.9-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial source-only packaging proposal (Closes: #1150415).
  * Package the project's Dardasha brand under its own name: the archive does
    not take the WhatsApp name or logo on an independent client, so the
    package installs Dardasha's name, application id
    (io.github.abdallah_shehawey.dardasha) and original artwork.
  * Depend on a separately packaged Electron 44 runtime, the major the
    upstream release bundles and Fedora's archive carries. Official archive
    inclusion is blocked by Debian Electron request #842420.
  * Install AppStream metadata and a manual page.
  * Build-depend on nodejs (>= 20): the test suite run during the build
    listens on an abstract unix socket, which Node refuses before 18.20.

 -- Abdallah Shehawey <shehawey9@gmail.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0200
